// title: regreSSHion   Remote Unauthenticated Code Execution Vulnerability in OpenSSH server
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceInfo
// purpose: regreSSHion Remote Unauthenticated Code Execution Vulnerability in OpenSSH server
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Azure/regreSSHion%20-%20Remote%20Unauthenticated%20Code%20Execution%20Vulnerability%20in%20OpenSSH%20server.kql
// kind: repo
